/* Pf002 - 30-minute STEP write on 214k-entity IFC-to-STEP conversion
   Pattern: huge entity count where the writer's serialization performs
   repeated linear scans over the entity table while resolving references.
   Cost is O(N^2) in entity count under naive writer.
   Scaling-up: this fixture has 40 representative entities. Multiply the
   CARTESIAN_POINT / VERTEX_POINT / EDGE_CURVE / ADVANCED_FACE pattern to
   ~50000 of each (~200k total) to reproduce the 30-minute write reported
   on the FZK Haus IfcStair model (pythonocc-core #660). The cost arises
   not from any individual entity but from writer reference indexing. */
